          <div class="text-white-50 small mb-2">Redes de cartoes</div>
          <div id="cardRotator" style="position:relative;height:250px;">
            <div class="card-slide" style="position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);transition:opacity 900ms ease,transform 900ms ease;">
              <img src="/images/cards/visa.webp" alt="Cartao Visa" style="height:250px;width:100%;max-width:420px;object-fit:contain;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:.5rem;" />
            </div>
            <div class="card-slide" style="position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);transition:opacity 900ms ease,transform 900ms ease;pointer-events:none;">
              <img src="/images/cards/unionpay.webp" alt="Cartao UnionPay" style="height:250px;width:100%;max-width:420px;object-fit:contain;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:.5rem;" />
            </div>
            <div class="card-slide" style="position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);transition:opacity 900ms ease,transform 900ms ease;pointer-events:none;">
              <img src="/images/cards/maestro.webp" alt="Cartao Maestro" style="height:250px;width:100%;max-width:420px;object-fit:contain;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:.5rem;" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-3 text-white-50 small">A disponibilidade de cartoes depende da jurisdicao e dos requisitos de conformidade.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div style="background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:.75rem;padding:1rem;height:100%;">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-2">
            <div class="text-white-50 small">Ultimos precos de referencia</div>
            <div class="text-white-50 small">Atualizado: <span id="rates-updated">—</span> UTC</div>
          </div>
          <div style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border-radius:.75rem;padding:1rem;">
            <div class="row g-3">
              <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="flex:0 0 50%;max-width:50%;"><div class="text-white-50 small">EUR/USDT</div><div class="text-white fw-semibold" style="font-size:1.15rem;" id="rate-EURUSDT">—</div></div>
              <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="flex:0 0 50%;max-width:50%;"><div class="text-white-50 small">USDC/USDT</div><div class="text-white fw-semibold" style="font-size:1.15rem;" id="rate-USDCUSDT">—</div></div>
              <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="flex:0 0 50%;max-width:50%;"><div class="text-white-50 small">BTC/USDT</div><div class="text-white fw-semibold" style="font-size:1.15rem;" id="rate-BTCUSDT">—</div></div>
              <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="flex:0 0 50%;max-width:50%;"><div class="text-white-50 small">ETH/USDT</div><div class="text-white fw-semibold" style="font-size:1.15rem;" id="rate-ETHUSDT">—</div></div>
              <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="flex:0 0 50%;max-width:50%;"><div class="text-white-50 small">BNB/USDT</div><div class="text-white fw-semibold" style="font-size:1.15rem;" id="rate-BNBUSDT">—</div></div>
              <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6" style="flex:0 0 50%;max-width:50%;"><div class="text-white-50 small">SOL/USDT</div><div class="text-white fw-semibold" style="font-size:1.15rem;" id="rate-SOLUSDT">—</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-white-50 small mt-3" style="line-height:1.4;">Estes sao precos de referencia (spot). As taxas de execucao podem diferir devido a comissoes, spreads e liquidez.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CRYPTO -->
